From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:04:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-usi: add Google gs201 USI

The USI blocks of the Google gs201 (Tensor G2) SoC are the same as on
gs101: the mode is selected through a PERIC sysreg register and the
block works with the exynos850-usi programming model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml
index c694926e5..3e0941f99 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/exynos-usi.yaml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - google,gs101-usi
+              - google,gs201-usi
               - samsung,exynos2200-usi
               - samsung,exynosautov9-usi
               - samsung,exynosautov920-usi
